# Root monorepo ignores
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
dist/
coverage/
gen/
# Exception: the MCP contract's generated TypeScript is TRACKED. The
# agent-studio workspace consumes @neryva/mcp-contract via a pnpm `file:`
# dependency, which snapshots the package at install time — gitignored
# gen/ts would silently vanish from the installed copy and break every
# fresh-clone build. `pnpm check:generated` enforces
# `buf generate && git diff --exit-code` on this path, so generated drift
# fails loudly instead of rotting.
!neryva_mcp/neryva-mcp-contract/gen/
.tmp/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
logs/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

